flowchart LR
    host[Host / CLI / Adapter]
    ffi[core/ffi
C ABI boundary]
    record[core/record
Canonical records]
    pipeline[core/pipeline
Stages + policy]
    plugin[core/plugin
Versioned optional extensions]
    codec[core/codec
Trusted text codec service]
    locale[core/localization
Human messages + fallback]
    io[core/sys/io
Display output]
    persistence[core/sif + core/sink
Canonical persistence]
    security[core/security
Crypto + keys + optional audit]
    audit[security/audit
Opt-in AUDIT pipeline]

    host --> ffi --> record --> pipeline
    plugin -. declared phases .-> pipeline
    pipeline --> persistence
    pipeline --> security
    security --> audit
    audit --> persistence
    host --> locale
    ffi --> locale
    locale --> codec
    codec --> io
    io --> host

    codec -. no authority over .-> persistence
    locale -. never transforms .-> audit
    plugin -. cannot replace .-> codec
    plugin -. cannot rewrite .-> security

